 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Eight Heads — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, as an action you can spend up to 8 cursed energy to summon an equal number of fangs from the jaws of <em>Yamata no Orochi</em> as shikigami. They appear in unoccupied spaces of your choice within 10 ft. You can have up to 8 summoned at a time. <br />\nYou can command any Fangs you have summoned as a bonus action. These Fangs disappear if you become unconscious and if destroyed cannot be resummoned for 1 minute. The Fangs hit points increase to 20 at 11th level.</p>",
